WEBVTT

00:09:58.335 --> 00:10:00.749
when we had family meetings --

00:10:00.773 --> 00:10:04.565
and it's not a huge family, but I have,
like, a couple of cousins --

00:10:04.589 --> 00:10:07.453
she would prep me beforehand.

00:10:07.477 --> 00:10:10.043
Like, before I stepped
into the room she would say,

00:10:10.067 --> 00:10:12.610
"OK. That's so-and-so ..."

00:10:13.925 --> 00:10:16.254
Because I was not --

00:10:16.278 --> 00:10:17.493
I was a geek.

00:10:17.517 --> 00:10:18.683
I was into computers,

00:10:18.707 --> 00:10:19.866
I was into math,

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.041
I was into physics.

00:10:21.065 --> 00:10:22.216
I was good at that.

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:25.026
I don't think I was
particularly exceptional.

00:10:25.554 --> 00:10:27.945
Apparently, my sister said

00:10:27.969 --> 00:10:34.820
that my biggest exceptional quality
was that I would not let go.